    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/cultural-festival/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Cultural Festival Theme is a dynamic and visually engaging solution designed for Cultural Event Organizers who want to showcase diverse celebrations, including local fairs, heritage events, and international festivals. Festival Hosts can highlight music performances, film screenings, and arts programs, while Event Planners can present detailed schedules, speaker or performer lineups, venue information, and ticketing options. City Governments and Tourism Boards can use the theme to promote community gatherings, seasonal events, and cultural attractions, providing easy access to event calendars, booking systems, and visitor information. Arts &amp; Culture Organizations can display exhibitions, workshops, and cultural initiatives, while Music Festival Organizers and Film Festival Organizers can feature performer profiles, movie screenings, and interactive program sections to attract attendees. With customizable layouts, integrated booking and ticketing plugins, and responsive design, the theme allows seamless online registration, schedule management, and event promotion. Social media integration, sponsor showcases, volunteer coordination, and email subscription tools enhance audience engagement, boost visibility, and ensure smooth management of cultural and entertainment events, making it an ideal choice for all festival and event-focused websites."
    },
